    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d235">

                <pb facs="0175" n="167" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg167"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1450: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant to the Representative of the
                        President</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ocheltree</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-07-17T17:00:00-06:00">July 17, 1939—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 8:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10. For Corrigan. The geographic data was presented under favorable circumstances
                    to President Carías and other officials of the Honduran Government this
                    afternoon in the Casa Presidential. I was accompanied by Secretary of Legation
                    Salter.</p>
                <p>The Chief of Protocol has stated on several occasions that if any result is to be
                    expected from the presentation of the material I should also stop over at San
                    Salvador to make similar presentation to Dr. Lainez<anchor n="38"
                        xml:id="d235-f1"/> in whom the President has largely confided Honduras’
                    relations with the Mediation Commission. In view of this the Department’s
                    authorization is requested to stop over at San Salvador. I am leaving
                    Tegucigalpa by plane on Wednesday and would leave San Salvador on Friday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ocheltree</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d235-f1" n="38" xml:id="d235-f1-content">
                <p>Chairman of the Honduran delegation to the mediation conference and Minister of
                    Honduras in El Salvador.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
